  "modules": [
    {
      "textRaw": "Pinyin - 汉语拼音",
      "name": "pinyin_-_汉语拼音",
      "desc": "<p><code>pinyin</code> 模块用于将汉字转换为拼音, 支持分词、姓氏模式、多音字和多种输出风格.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>源码依据: <code>runtime/api/augment/pinyin/Pinyin.kt</code>, <code>runtime/api/augment/pinyin/PinyinCore.kt</code>, <code>runtime/api/augment/pinyin/Util.kt</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">pinyin</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "[@] pinyin",
          "name": "[@]_pinyin",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "pinyin(hans, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "pinyin",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<p><code>pinyin(...)</code> 与 <a href=\"#m-convert\">pinyin.convert(...)</a> 等价.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "hans"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[@] pinyin"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] convert",
          "name": "[m]_convert",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "convert(hans, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "convert",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>hans</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 待转换字符串</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> {{<ul>\n<li><strong>style</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <code>PinyinStyle</code> } - 输出风格, 默认 <code>STYLE_TONE</code></li>\n<li><strong>mode</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <code>PinyinMode</code> } - 转换模式, 默认 <code>MODE_NORMAL</code></li>\n<li><strong>segment</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否启用 Jieba 分词, 默认 <code>false</code></li>\n<li><strong>heteronym</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否启用多音字, 默认 <code>false</code></li>\n<li><strong>group</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否组合词组结果, 默认 <code>false</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>}}</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#array\">array</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>返回二维数组. 每个汉字、词组或连续非汉字片段对应一个拼音候选数组. 返回数组额外绑定只读不可枚举的 <code>compact()</code> 方法; 该方法会对各组候选做笛卡尔组合, 返回二维组合结果.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">console.log(pinyin.convert(&#39;重庆&#39;));\nconsole.log(pinyin.convert(&#39;重庆&#39;, { heteronym: true }));\nconsole.log(pinyin.convert(&#39;朝阳东升&#39;, { segment: true, heteronym: true }).compact());\n</code></pre>\n<p>转换流程:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>hans</code> 会先转为字符串; 空字符串返回空数组.</li>\n<li><code>options</code> 不是 JavaScript 对象时会按空对象处理.</li>\n<li><code>segment: true</code> 时使用 Jieba <code>cutSmall(hans, 4)</code> 分词; 否则按连续汉字/非汉字分组.</li>\n<li>非汉字片段会原样保留为单项数组.</li>\n<li>词组优先查 <code>PhrasesDict</code>; 查不到时退回单字转换.</li>\n<li><code>heteronym: true</code> 时返回多音字候选; 单字分支会去重, 默认只取第一个候选.</li>\n<li><code>group: true</code> 只影响普通转换分支, 会把一个词组内各字候选拼接成一组候选字符串; <code>false</code> 时按字/词组拆成多组.</li>\n</ul>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "hans"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] convert"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] simple",
          "name": "[m]_simple",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "simple(str, enableNumericTone?, enableSegment?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "simple",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>str</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>[ enableNumericTone = <code>false</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>[ enableSegment = <code>false</code> ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>返回拼接后的简化拼音字符串. <code>enableNumericTone</code> 为 <code>true</code> 时使用 <code>STYLE_TONE2</code>, 否则使用 <code>STYLE_NORMAL</code>; <code>enableSegment</code> 对应 <code>segment</code> 选项.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">console.log(pinyin.simple(&#39;中文&#39;)); // zhongwen\nconsole.log(pinyin.simple(&#39;中文&#39;, true)); // zhong1wen2\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "str"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "enableNumericTone?"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "enableSegment?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] simple"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] fromCodePoint",
          "name": "[m]_fromcodepoint",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "fromCodePoint(codePoint)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "fromCodePoint",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>codePoint</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | null }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>按 Unicode code point 查询单字拼音. 返回字典中的原始拼音字符串; 不存在时返回 <code>null</code>.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
