        {
          "textRaw": "[m] fromPhrase",
          "name": "[m]_fromphrase",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "fromPhrase(phrase)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "fromPhrase",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>phrase</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#array\">array</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>查询词组拼音字典, 返回按 <code>OrderIndex ASC</code> 排列的二维数组. 未命中时返回空数组.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
